# Pyrite Building elevator (native C5) for build/test_story_route, from the
# Colosseum checkpoint (private/pyrite/saves/pyrite-2-colosseum.gci, floor
# 0x78). The building is one-way (docs/pyrite-story.md): 1F stairs, 2F
# stairs to 3F's hall; 3F door row 34 and the outside ramp to the town
# walkway; the walkway door to 4F. 4F's stairs lead to 3F's elevator room,
# which holds the up-ramp; its elevator (row 140) goes down to 1F's
# elevator room (row 138), whose gate (1F function 12) lets Wes out.
floor 0x78 0
expect 0x409 1
door 2
at 35 -339
expect 0x40a 1
expect 0x40b 1
expect_floor 0x19
door 6
door 5
expect_floor 0x1b
expect_near -2 -90 12
# 3F hall to the outside ramp (door row 34, surface 6, then surface 10):
# its people stand in the corridors, so this step teleports.
door 10
expect_floor 0x0f
door 6
expect_floor 0x1c
door 4
expect_floor 0x1b
expect_near -22 -130 12
walk -13 -130
walk -10 -146
# Down: the arrival must leave Wes in 1F's elevator room, not at entrance 0.
touch 9
expect_floor 0x19
expect_near 3 -51 12
# Up again: 3F's elevator room, then the ramp to 4F.
touch 4
expect_floor 0x1b
expect_near -10 -150 12
walk -20 -140
walk -20 -118
door 7
expect_floor 0x1c
# Down once more and out through 1F's gate (function 12, door row 164).
door 4
expect_floor 0x1b
walk -13 -130
walk -10 -146
touch 9
expect_floor 0x19
touch 11
expect_near 2 7 12
